            {
              "name": "messages",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify([{\n  role: \"user\",\n  content: `You are a professional document digitization expert specializing in high-fidelity OCR and structural preservation.\n\nTask: Transcribe the attached document into clean Markdown text.\n\nGuidelines:\n\nFidelity: Transcribe every piece of text exactly as written. Do not summarize, do not paraphrase, and do not skip any sections.\n\nStructural Formatting: >    - Use Markdown headers (#, ##) for titles and sections.\n\nUse Markdown tables for any tabular data found.\n\nUse bullet points for lists.\n\nImage Description: For any non-text elements (charts, diagrams, or photos), provide a brief, objective description in brackets, e.g., [Diagram showing the flow of water through a turbine].\n\nNo Meta-Talk: Do not begin your response with \"Here is the transcription\" or \"I have processed the document.\" Provide only the transcribed content.\n\nHandling Artifacts: If a word is illegible, mark it as [illegible]. Ignore watermarks or page numbers if they interrupt the flow of a sentence.\n\nOutput: Raw Markdown text only.`\n}])\n}}"
            },
            {
